WEBVTT

00:08:59.034 --> 00:09:03.914
can insist on bringing in the senior
to have their lawyer question them.

00:09:05.332 --> 00:09:06.458
As you can imagine,

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.712
this is very tough
in cases with older victims.

00:09:10.379 --> 00:09:12.798
I think of one case I prosecuted,

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.551
where the elderly woman
sat in her wheelchair

00:09:15.551 --> 00:09:17.344
outside the courtroom for hours,

00:09:17.344 --> 00:09:18.637
waiting to testify.

00:09:19.888 --> 00:09:21.432
Other cases overran.

00:09:22.474 --> 00:09:26.895
Eventually, cold and tired
and in pain, she just started crying.

00:09:27.563 --> 00:09:30.107
We really need to figure out
better solutions.